    "title": "Usage insights and the nightly rollup",
    "locale": "en",
    "output": "app/public/learn/insights.html",
    "quality_profile": "showcase"
  },
  "stages": [
    {
      "label": "Trigger"
    },
    {
      "label": "Worker code"
    },
    {
      "label": "Record"
    },
    {
      "label": "Route"
    },
    {
      "label": "Read"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "calls",
      "type": "external",
      "label": "API calls",
      "sublabel": "site and app",
      "stage": 0,
      "row": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "worker",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "Worker",
      "sublabel": "calls track()",
      "stage": 1,
      "row": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "analytics",
      "type": "database",
      "label": "Analytics Engine",
      "sublabel": "cloudflare_free_events",
      "stage": 2,
      "row": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "logs",
      "type": "cloud",
      "label": "Workers Logs",
      "sublabel": "+ Traces, Issues",
      "stage": 2,
      "row": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "cron",
      "type": "cloud",
      "label": "Cron Trigger",
      "sublabel": "03:17 UTC",
      "stage": 0,
      "row": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "rollup",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "Rollup job",
      "sublabel": "handleScheduled",
      "stage": 1,
      "row": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "d1",
      "type": "database",
      "label": "D1",
      "sublabel": "daily_stats, tables",
      "stage": 2,
      "row": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "stats-route",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "Stats route",
      "sublabel": "GET /api/stats",
      "stage": 3,
      "row": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "admin-route",
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "Admin route",
      "sublabel": "/api/admin/overview",
      "stage": 3,
      "row": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "admin-page",
      "type": "frontend",
      "label": "Admin page",
      "sublabel": "owner only",
      "stage": 4,
      "row": 2
    }
  ],
  "flows": [
    {
      "id": "api-call",
      "from": "calls",
      "to": "worker",
      "label": "request",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "data-point",
      "from": "worker",
      "to": "analytics",
      "label": "data point",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "observe",
      "from": "worker",
      "to": "logs",
      "label": "observability config",
      "variant": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "nightly",
      "from": "cron",
      "to": "rollup",
      "label": "17 3 * * *",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "save-totals",
      "from": "rollup",
      "to": "d1",
      "label": "save totals",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "latest-row",
      "from": "d1",
      "to": "stats-route",
      "label": "latest row",
      "variant": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "live-counts",
      "from": "d1",
      "to": "admin-route",
      "label": "live counts",
      "variant": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary",
      "from": "admin-route",
      "to": "admin-page",
      "label": "summary",
      "variant": "default"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Events with track()",
      "items": [
        "Routes, the queue, the Workflow, email and cron code call track(), one data point per event",
        "Each point keeps the event, detail and country, plus the user id or anon",
        "Free: 100,000 data points a day and 10,000 SQL API queries to read them"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Logs, traces and errors",
      "items": [
        "The observability setting in wrangler.jsonc records every request (head_sampling_rate 1)",
        "Workers Logs: 200,000 events a day, kept 3 days; from 1 December logs, traces and Issues share 0.5 GB a day, kept 7 days",
        "You read them in the Cloudflare dashboard; source maps keep stack traces readable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "The nightly rollup",
      "items": [
        "A Cron Trigger (17 3 * * *) runs the scheduled handler; each run costs one Worker request",
        "It counts members, published and pending posts, messages and inbox, then saves one daily_stats row",
        "GET /api/stats returns the latest row; the Admin page counts live instead"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
